{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"cb901a209163d666","type":"text","text":"# NetBIOS","x":-442,"y":-60,"width":128,"height":60},
		{"id":"65530cdafc23b242","type":"text","text":"A NetBIOS name is a unique `16 ASCII Character string`  used to `identify the network device` over TCP/IP. \n`15 Character used for ` device name\n`1 Character used for ` service or name record type","x":-240,"y":-87,"width":447,"height":115},
		{"id":"29c8648c325c2ac0","type":"text","text":"| Name                | NetBIOS Code | Type   | Information Obtained         |\n| ------------------- | ------------ | ------ | ---------------------------- |\n| Computer Name       | `<00>`       | UNIQUE | Computer ka hostname         |\n| Domain Name         | `<00>`       | GROUP  | Workgroup/Domain name        |\n| File Server Service | `<20>`       | UNIQUE | SMB/File sharing enabled hai |\n| Domain Controller   | `<1C>`       | GROUP  | Domain controllers ki list   |\n| Master Browser      | `<1D>`       | UNIQUE | Network browser master       |\n| Browser Service     | `<1E>`       | GROUP  | Browser election service     |\n| Logged-in Username  | `<03>`       | UNIQUE | User session information     |\n","x":300,"y":-157,"width":633,"height":255},
		{"id":"5631ab3b56feb69f","type":"text","text":"### nbtstat utility","x":1197,"y":-346,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"b431b3ad51feaae9","type":"text","text":"nbtstat ek Windows command-line utility hai jo NetBIOS over TCP/IP (NetBT) ki information dikhati hai.\n\n👉 Simple words:\n\n> nbtstat se NetBIOS name table, remote computer ka naam, IP mapping aur NetBIOS cache dekh sakte ho.","x":1560,"y":-427,"width":471,"height":223},
		{"id":"b9f8db26a5436900","type":"text","text":"#### Ye kis protocol ke saath use hoti hai?\n- NetBIOS\n- NetBT (NetBIOS over TCP/IP)\n\n|Port|Service|\n|---|---|\n|UDP 137|NetBIOS Name Service (NBNS)|\n|UDP 138|NetBIOS Datagram Service|\n|TCP 139|NetBIOS Session Service|","x":2200,"y":-445,"width":359,"height":260},
		{"id":"3903eaefbefa429e","type":"text","text":"`nbtstat -A 192.168.1.10`","x":2660,"y":-345,"width":216,"height":60},
		{"id":"1c9e8a177a0864ec","type":"text","text":"| Command                 | Purpose                                    |\n| ----------------------- | ------------------------------------------ |\n| `nbtstat -n`            | Local NetBIOS names dikhata hai            |\n| `nbtstat -c`            | NetBIOS name cache dikhata hai             |\n| `nbtstat -r`            | Name resolution statistics                 |\n| `nbtstat -R`            | NetBIOS cache clear karke reload karta hai |\n| `nbtstat -RR`           | Name registration refresh karta hai        |\n| `nbtstat -a <hostname>` | Hostname se NetBIOS table dikhata hai      |\n| `nbtstat -A <IP>`       | IP address se NetBIOS table dikhata hai    |\n| `nbtstat -s`            | Active NetBIOS sessions dikhata hai        |\n| `nbtstat -S`            | Sessions + IP addresses dikhata hai        |\n","x":2502,"y":-800,"width":533,"height":310},
		{"id":"9a36c548002782c0","type":"text","text":"#### Cybersecurity me nbtstat\nAgar NetBIOS enabled ho, to attacker ya pentester ko mil sakta hai:\n\n```\nComputer Name\nWorkgroup/Domain Name\nNetBIOS Services\nLogged-in User (kabhi-kabhi indirectly)\nMAC Address (other tools ke saath)\nFile Sharing Information (SMB enumeration ke saath)\n```","x":3160,"y":-791,"width":532,"height":293},
		{"id":"8340ca9bd2e04175","type":"text","text":"| `nbtstat`              | `nbtscan`                      |\n| ---------------------- | ------------------------------ |\n| Windows utility        | Linux/Kali tool                |\n| Ek host ki information | Puri subnet scan kar sakta hai |\n| Built-in               | Alag tool install hota hai     |\n","x":2992,"y":-382,"width":434,"height":134},
		{"id":"f510fc948935b6d2","type":"text","text":"| Point         | Answer                                 |\n| ------------- | -------------------------------------- |\n| Utility       | `nbtstat`                              |\n| Purpose       | NetBIOS over TCP/IP information dekhna |\n| Platform      | Windows                                |\n| `-n`          | Local NetBIOS names                    |\n| `-c`          | NetBIOS cache                          |\n| `-A`          | IP se remote NetBIOS table             |\n| `-a`          | Hostname se remote NetBIOS table       |\n| `-s`          | Active sessions                        |\n| Related Ports | UDP 137, UDP 138, TCP 139              |\n","x":2542,"y":-140,"width":453,"height":310},
		{"id":"235aca4548574156","type":"text","text":"###### Tools\n- NetBIOS Enumerator\n- Nmap\n###### Enumerationg User Account\n\n- PsExec\n- PsFile\n- PsGetSid\n- PsKill\n- PsInfo\n- PsList\n- PsLoggedOn\n- PsLogList\n- PsPasswd\n- PsShutdown\n","x":3303,"y":-1260,"width":246,"height":431},
		{"id":"9bbb381091c592ea","type":"text","text":"### NetView Utility","x":1197,"y":113,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"85f3b23024893d99","type":"text","text":"net view ek Windows command hai jo network me available computers aur shared resources (folders/printers) ko dikhata hai.\n\n👉 Simple words:\n\n> net view = Network me kaunse computers aur unke shared folders available hain, ye dekhna.","x":1560,"y":31,"width":471,"height":225},
		{"id":"7176bdca190360a0","x":1220,"y":-220,"width":324,"height":282,"type":"text","text":"```\n               Network\n\t\t\t|\n     +-----------+-----------+\n     |           |           |\n   PC-01      SERVER      HR-PC\n                  |\n          ----------------\n          |              |\n      SharedDocs     Printer\n```"},
		{"id":"2ed50781df720686","x":2031,"y":300,"width":421,"height":268,"type":"text","text":"##### Cybersecurity me net view\nEnumeration ke time net view se pata chal sakta hai:\n\n```\nNetwork me kitne computers hain\nServer ka naam\nShared folders\nShared printers\nDomain information\n```"},
		{"id":"d8c4ea1075fef9be","x":2600,"y":274,"width":656,"height":134,"type":"text","text":"| `net view`                               | `nbtstat`                              |\n| ---------------------------------------- | -------------------------------------- |\n| Network computers aur shares dikhata hai | NetBIOS information dikhata hai        |\n| SMB shares enumerate karta hai           | NetBIOS name table enumerate karta hai |\n| File sharing se related                  | NetBIOS service se related             |\n"},
		{"id":"18c0902cc6527f52","x":2600,"y":434,"width":505,"height":169,"type":"text","text":"| Category           | Commands                                                 |\n| ------------------ | -------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 👤 **Users**       | `whoami`, `net user`, `net group`, `net localgroup`      |\n| 🖥️ **System**     | `hostname`, `systeminfo`, `tasklist`, `sc query`         |\n| 🌐 **Network**     | `ipconfig`, `arp`, `route`, `netstat`, `ping`, `tracert` |\n| 📂 **Enumeration** | `net view`, `net share`, `nbtstat`, `nslookup`           |\n"},
		{"id":"0e23be94bc2a2576","x":735,"y":300,"width":805,"height":640,"type":"text","text":"| Command                                 | Purpose (Kis Liye Hai?)                                      |\n| --------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| `net view`                              | Network me available **computers** dekhne ke liye            |\n| `net view \\\\SERVER`                     | Kisi server ke **shared folders/printers** dekhne ke liye    |\n| `net view /domain`                      | Network ke **domains** dekhne ke liye                        |\n| `net view /domain:COMPANY`              | Specific domain ke computers dekhne ke liye                  |\n| `nbtstat -n`                            | Local **NetBIOS names** dekhne ke liye                       |\n| `nbtstat -c`                            | NetBIOS **cache** dekhne ke liye                             |\n| `nbtstat -r`                            | NetBIOS **name resolution statistics** dekhne ke liye        |\n| `nbtstat -R`                            | NetBIOS **cache clear & reload** karne ke liye               |\n| `nbtstat -RR`                           | NetBIOS **name registration refresh** karne ke liye          |\n| `nbtstat -a <Hostname>`                 | Hostname se **NetBIOS information** dekhne ke liye           |\n| `nbtstat -A <IP>`                       | IP address se **NetBIOS information** dekhne ke liye         |\n| `nbtstat -s`                            | Active **NetBIOS sessions** dekhne ke liye                   |\n| `nbtstat -S`                            | Sessions + **IP addresses** dekhne ke liye                   |\n| `net user`                              | Local **users** ki list dekhne ke liye                       |\n| `net user <username>`                   | Specific user ki details dekhne ke liye                      |\n| `net user /domain`                      | Domain ke **users** dekhne ke liye                           |\n| `net group`                             | Local **groups** dekhne ke liye                              |\n| `net group /domain`                     | Domain ke **groups** dekhne ke liye                          |\n| `net group \"Domain Admins\" /domain`     | **Domain Admins** group ke members dekhne ke liye            |\n| `net group \"Domain Users\" /domain`      | **Domain Users** ke members dekhne ke liye                   |\n| `net localgroup`                        | Local groups ki list dekhne ke liye                          |\n\n"},
		{"id":"689646e5ad1d1432","x":1560,"y":300,"width":409,"height":475,"type":"text","text":"| Command             | Information Milti Hai      |\n| ------------------- | -------------------------- |\n| `net view`          | Network Computers & Shares |\n| `nbtstat -A <IP>`   | NetBIOS Name Table         |\n| `net user`          | Users                      |\n| `net user /domain`  | Domain Users               |\n| `net group /domain` | Domain Groups              |\n| `net share`         | Shared Folders             |\n| `whoami /all`       | Current User + Privileges  |\n| `hostname`          | Hostname                   |\n| `systeminfo`        | OS & System Information    |\n| `ipconfig /all`     | Network Configuration      |\n| `arp -a`            | IP ↔ MAC Mapping           |\n| `route print`       | Routing Information        |\n| `netstat -ano`      | Open Ports & PID           |\n| `tasklist`          | Running Processes          |\n| `sc query`          | Running Services           |\n"},
		{"id":"0a427eca5e62922b","x":-240,"y":300,"width":800,"height":169,"type":"text","text":"| Command                         | Purpose                                                                       |\n| ------------------------------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `net view`                      | Network me available **sabhi computers** ki list dikhata hai.                 |\n| `net view \\\\<ComputerName>`     | Kisi specific computer/server ke **shared folders aur printers** dikhata hai. |\n| `net view /domain`              | Network me available **domains/workgroups** ki list dikhata hai.              |\n| `net view /domain:<DomainName>` | Kisi specific **domain** ke andar available **computers** dikhata hai.        |\n"},
		{"id":"aa69c130681e63a3","x":-240,"y":496,"width":467,"height":169,"type":"text","text":"| Command                    | Output                              |\n| -------------------------- | ----------------------------------- |\n| `net view`                 | `\\\\SERVER`, `\\\\HR-PC`, `\\\\PC01`     |\n| `net view \\\\SERVER`        | `Public`, `Documents`, `Printer`    |\n| `net view /domain`         | `WORKGROUP`, `COMPANY`              |\n| `net view /domain:COMPANY` | `\\\\DC01`, `\\\\HR-PC`, `\\\\FILESERVER` |\n"},
		{"id":"e54e3b966cdc6e7b","x":2031,"y":620,"width":786,"height":805,"type":"text","text":"| `net localgroup administrators`         | Local **Administrators** group members dekhne ke liye        |\n| --------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| `net localgroup \"Remote Desktop Users\"` | RDP access wale users dekhne ke liye                         |\n| `net share`                             | Local **shared folders** dekhne ke liye                      |\n| `whoami`                                | Current logged-in user dekhne ke liye                        |\n| `whoami /all`                           | User + Groups + Privileges ki puri information               |\n| `whoami /groups`                        | Current user ke groups dekhne ke liye                        |\n| `whoami /priv`                          | Current user ke privileges dekhne ke liye                    |\n| `hostname`                              | Computer ka **hostname** dekhne ke liye                      |\n| `systeminfo`                            | OS version, patches, RAM, hostname, boot time ki information |\n| `ipconfig`                              | Current IP address dekhne ke liye                            |\n| `ipconfig /all`                         | Complete network configuration dekhne ke liye                |\n| `ipconfig /displaydns`                  | DNS cache dekhne ke liye                                     |\n| `ipconfig /flushdns`                    | DNS cache clear karne ke liye                                |\n| `arp -a`                                | IP ↔ MAC Address mapping (ARP table) dekhne ke liye          |\n| `route print`                           | Routing table dekhne ke liye                                 |\n| `netstat -an`                           | Open ports aur active connections dekhne ke liye             |\n| `netstat -ano`                          | Open ports + Process ID (PID) dekhne ke liye                 |\n| `netstat -rn`                           | Routing table numeric format me dekhne ke liye               |\n| `tasklist`                              | Running processes dekhne ke liye                             |\n| `tasklist /svc`                         | Processes ke saath unki services dekhne ke liye              |\n| `sc query`                              | Running services dekhne ke liye                              |\n| `sc query state= all`                   | Sabhi services (running + stopped) dekhne ke liye            |\n| `query user`                            | Logged-in users dekhne ke liye                               |\n| `query session`                         | Active user sessions dekhne ke liye                          |\n| `nslookup`                              | Interactive DNS query mode start karne ke liye               |\n| `nslookup google.com`                   | Domain ka IP address resolve karne ke liye                   |\n| `ping <IP/Domain>`                      | Connectivity test karne ke liye                              |\n| `tracert <Domain>`                      | Packet ka route (path) dekhne ke liye                        |"}
	],
